```yaml
<!-- DOCSUB_INSERT ruleset_example_misuse_metrics -->
```

The `*.pca.coordinates` fields are included to allow visualization of the traces. They do not contribute to the guardrail score.

The `response.pii` metric comprises a set of individual PII metrics as described in the section on [Secure Container Metrics](/llm-metrics#pii)

The `prompt.topics` metric comprises the set of individual topic metrics specified in the yaml above, e.g. `prompt.topics.medicine` and `prompt.topics.legal`.

The overall guardrail score for the prompt is calculated by first normalizing the constituent metrics to be within the range from
0 to 100 and then taking the maximum value of the normalized metrics.

